 ],
 "notes": "Package installs accepted from recipe UserDataOverride, custom Component Data, or (.NET) a managed component. Instance role policies are unstated in the prompt so only extra. A distribution gated off by default still counts if it declares the organization ARN and the all group, since the ID is configurable. Which subnet is 'private' isn't fully observable: infra_wiring requires the build subnet not to auto-assign public IPs, and whether its route goes through the NAT would take a chain of references a leaf can't express. A literal ami- parent image fails parent_al2023 on purpose, because nothing in the template then shows it is Amazon Linux 2023."
}
